  "description": "Getting transported into a novel once? Unusual. Twice? Welcome to Ji-an Han’s reality. Her second possession lands her in the body of a noble lady with an unfortunate reputation—the court fool. While still adjusting to this twist of fate, the enigmatic Crown Prince Iskan enters the scene with an unsettling proposition: \"Take me as yours,\" he says, \"I’ll become your most cherished possession.\" Between her reputation as a fool and a prince whose motives remain unclear, can Ji-an navigate this complicated new reality?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
